ATP fixture for VMC-ATP-018. Test instrumentation, not part of the product.

Builds a test arena in chunk (1,1) when the chunk is loaded at startup:
  - floor: stone at Y=110 from X=17..30, Z=17..30;
  - walls: glass, Y=111..113, along X=17, X=30, Z=17 and Z=30;
  - rise: one stone block high (Y=111) along Z=25, X=18..29.
Logs "ATP arena ready". Use an empty world directory and delete it after the test.

Apply at the repository root:   git apply tools/atp/patches/<this file>
Remove it after the test:       git apply -R tools/atp/patches/<this file>

